A maker configures inbound SIP X-headers for a voice-enabled agent. A <b>Parse value</b> node reads <code>Conversation.SipXHeader</code> by using this sample schema and saves the result in a global variable. The external IVR sends the headers <code>X-CallID</code> and <code>x-AAI-Incoming</code>.
<pre>{
  "X-CallID": "",
  "x-AAI-Incoming": ""
}</pre>
For each statement, select <b>Yes</b> if it is true.
